                <pb facs="0841" n="827" sameAs="frus:frus1944v07/pg827"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">103.9169 Bogotá: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Daniels</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-16">May 16, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>649. From FEA, for La Spina. Embassy’s A–849, May 5. Suggest you do not postpone
                    processing of import recommendations. When possible you will be informed on
                    categories to be eliminated from decentralization, July 1, 1944. [FEA.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
